2026-11-06T03:02:45.0081846Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0082418Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0082824Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0083423Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0084090Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0084564Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0094501Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0095368Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0104752Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0105532Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0105878Z 
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0106225Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-06T03:02:45.0106696Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
